Starting from the date of the official release, the entire Software shall be distributed under the terms of the MIT License.
The MIT License shall apply to all versions of the Software, including versions created and published before the official release, as well as all subsequent versions.
Consequently, after the official release, the restrictions established by this license shall no longer apply to the Software, including its previous versions.
The official release must be announced or published by the copyright holder through an official project distribution channel.

